  "updated_at": "2026-10-19T19:48:58Z",
  "body": "Thanks for linking the existing issue.\n\nI encountered this in an Angular/Ionic application's Jest/jsdom tests, using `jest-preset-angular` and `setupZoneTestEnv()`. The test setup loads Zone.js through CommonJS, which selects the affected UMD bundle.\nRxDB’s migration code calls `Promise.all()` with a `Set` of pending writes.\n\nThe standalone Node example was only intended as a minimal reproduction. Mapping Zone.js to its ESM bundles in Jest resolves the failures.",
  "author_association": "NONE",
